{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-1","title":"Ezekiel 11:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The presumption of the princes. 4 Their sin and judgment. 13 Ezekiel complaining, God shews him his purpose in saving a remnant; 21 and punishing the wicked. 22 The glory of God leaves the city. 24 Ezekiel is returned to the captivity.</p>\n<p>the spirit. 24; 3:12,14; 8:3; 37:1; 40:1,2; 41:1; 1Ki 18:12; 2Ki 2:16; Ac 8:39 2Co 12:1-4; Re 1:10 the east. 10:19; 43:4 behold. 8:16 Jaazaniah. 2Ki 25:23 Pelatiah. 13; 22:27; Isa 1:10,23; Ho 5:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-2","title":"Ezekiel 11:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>Es 8:3; Ps 2:1,2; 36:4; 52:2; Isa 30:1; 59:4; Jer 5:5; 18:18 Mic 2:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-3","title":"Ezekiel 11:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>It is not, etc. or, It is not for us to build houses near. 7:7; 12:22,27; Isa 5:19; Jer 1:11,12; Am 6:5; 2Pe 3:4 this city. 7-11; 24:3-14; Jer 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-4","title":"Ezekiel 11:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>3:2-15,17-21; 20:46,47; 21:2; 25:2; Isa 58:1; Ho 6:5; 8:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-5","title":"Ezekiel 11:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the Spirit. 2:2; 3:24,27; 8:1; Nu 11:25,26; 1Sa 10:6,10; Ac 10:44; 11:15 Speak. 2:4,5,7; 3:11; Isa 58:1 Thus have. 28:2; 29:3; 38:11; Ps 50:21; Isa 28:15; Mal 3:13,14; Mr 3:22-30 Jas 3:6 for. 38:10; 1Ch 28:9; Ps 7:9; 139:2,3; Jer 16:17; 17:10; Mr 2:8; Joh 2:24 Joh 2:25; 21:17; Heb 4:13; Re 2:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-6","title":"Ezekiel 11:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>7:23; 9:9; 22:2-6,9,12,27; 24:6-9; 2Ki 21:16; Isa 1:15; Jer 2:30,34 Jer 7:6,9; La 4:13; Ho 4:2,3; Mic 3:2,3,10; 7:2; Zep 3:3; Mt 23:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-7","title":"Ezekiel 11:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>Your. 24:3-13; Mic 3:2,3 but. 3:9-11; 2Ki 25:18-22; Jer 52:24-27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-8","title":"Ezekiel 11:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Job 3:25; 20:24; Pr 10:24; Isa 24:17,18; 30:16,17; 66:4 Jer 38:19-23; 42:14-16; 44:12,13; Am 9:1-4; Joh 11:48; 1Th 2:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-9","title":"Ezekiel 11:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>and deliver. 21:31; De 28:36,49,50; 2Ki 24:4; Ne 9:36,37; Ps 106:41 Jer 5:15-17; 39:6 and will. 5:8,10,15; 16:38,41; 30:19; Ps 106:30; Ec 8:11; Joh 5:27; Ro 13:4 Jude 1:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-10","title":"Ezekiel 11:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>fall. 2Ki 25:19-21; Jer 39:6; 52:9,10,24-27 in. Nu 34:8,9; Jos 13:5; 1Ki 8:65; 2Ki 14:25 and ye. 6:7; 13:9,14,21,23; Ps 9:16; Jer 9:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-11","title":"Ezekiel 11:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>3,7-10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-12","title":"Ezekiel 11:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>for we have not walked. or, which have not walked. 21; 20:16,21,24; Le 26:40; 1Ki 11:33; 2Ki 21:22; Ezr 9:7; Ne 9:34 Ps 78:10; Jer 6:16; Da 9:10 but. 8:10,14,16; 16:44-47; Le 18:3,24-28; De 12:30,31; 2Ki 16:3,10,11 2Ki 17:11-23; 18:12; 21:2; 2Ch 13:9; 28:3; 33:2-9; 36:14 Ps 106:35-39; Jer 10:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-13","title":"Ezekiel 11:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>And it.Whilst the prophet, in vision, was delivering this message to the princes, Pelatiah suddenly died; and it is highly probable the he was actually struck dead at this very time, in so remarkable a manner as to render the vision much noticed. The prophet, alarmed and distressed for the welfare of his people, anxiously enquired whether the Lord meant to destroy the remnant of Israel.</p>\n<p>when. 1; 37:7; Nu 14:35-37; De 7:4; 1Ki 13:4; Pr 6:15; Jer 28:15-17 Ho 6:5; Ac 5:5,10; 13:11 Then. De 9:18,19; Jos 7:6-9; 1Ch 21:16,17; Ps 106:23; 119:120 Ah. 9:8; Am 7:2,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-15","title":"Ezekiel 11:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>thy brethren. Jer 24:1-5 Get. Isa 65:5; 66:5; Joh 16:2 unto. 33:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-16","title":"Ezekiel 11:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>Thus saith. Le 26:44; De 30:3,4; 2Ki 24:12-16; Ps 44:11; Jer 24:5,6; 30:11 Jer 31:10 as a. Ps 31:20; 90:1; 91:1,9-16; Pr 18:10; Isa 4:5; 8:14; Jer 26:7,11 Jer 42:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-17","title":"Ezekiel 11:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>28:25; 34:13; 36:24; 37:21-28; 39:27-29; Isa 11:11-16; Jer 3:12,18 Jer 24:5; 30:10,11,18; 31:8-10; 32:37-41; Ho 1:10,11; Am 9:14,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-18","title":"Ezekiel 11:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>21; 5:11; 7:20; 37:23; 42:7,8; Isa 1:25-27; 30:22; Jer 16:18; Ho 14:8 Mic 5:10-14; Col 3:5-8; Tit 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-19","title":"Ezekiel 11:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>I will give. 36:26,27; De 30:6; 2Ch 30:12; Jer 24:7; 32:39,40; Zep 3:9 Joh 17:21-23; Ac 4:32; 1Co 1:10; Eph 4:3-6; Php 2:1-5 I will put. 18:31; 2Ki 22:19; Ps 51:10; Jer 31:33; Lu 11:13; Joh 14:26; Ro 11:2 2Co 5:17; Ga 6:15; Eph 4:23 I will take. 36:26,27; Isa 48:4; Zec 7:12; Ro 2:4,5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-20","title":"Ezekiel 11:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>they may. 12; Ps 105:45; 119:4,5,32; Lu 1:6,74,75; Ro 16:26; 1Co 11:2 Tit 2:11,12 and they. 14:11; 36:28; 37:27; Jer 11:4; 24:7; 30:22; 31:33; 32:38; Ho 2:23 Zec 13:9; Heb 8:10; 11:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-21","title":"Ezekiel 11:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>whose. Ec 11:9; Jer 17:9; Mr 7:21-23; Heb 3:12,13; 10:38; Jas 1:14,15 Jude 1:19 their detestable. 18; Jer 1:16; 2:20 I will. 9:10; 20:31,38; 22:31; Jer 29:16-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-22","title":"Ezekiel 11:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>1:19,20; 10:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-23","title":"Ezekiel 11:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":11,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>the glory. 8:4; 9:3; 10:4,18; 43:4; Zec 14:4; Mt 23:37-39; 24:1,2 which. 43:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-ezk-11-24","title":"Ezekiel 11:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"EZK","chapterStart":11,"verseStart"